{
  "id": "water___speed_of_sound_vs__temperature",
  "title": "Water - Speed of Sound vs. Temperature",
  "description": "Speed of sound in water at temperatures ranging 32 - 212°F (0 - 100°C) - Imperial and SI units.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Speed of Sound in Water\n\nCalculate the speed of sound in water based on temperature. This tool provides data for temperatures ranging from 32°F to 212°F (0°C to 100°C) in both imperial and SI units.\n\n**Note:** Speed of sound in water increases with temperature up to approximately 74°C, then decreases at higher temperatures."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_f",
          "label": "Temperature (°F)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 68,
          "unit": "°F"
        },
        {
          "id": "unit_system",
          "label": "Unit System",
          "type": "select",
          "defaultValue": "imperial",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Imperial (ft/s)",
              "value": "imperial"
            },
            {
              "label": "SI (m/s)",
              "value": "si"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "speed_of_sound_result",
          "label": "Speed of Sound",
          "formula": "inputs.unit_system == 'imperial' ? (1403 + (inputs.temperature_f - 32) * 5/9 * 0.16) * 3.28 : 1403 + (inputs.temperature_f - 32) * 5/9 * 0.16",
          "unit": "inputs.unit_system == 'imperial' ? 'ft/s' : 'm/s'",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
